   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "2019-11-12",
   "text": "Veterans and Consumers Fair Credit Act \n This bill applies certain military consumer credit protections to all consumers. Specifically, the bill caps the interest rate on extensions of consumer credit at 36%."
